# wear/woman/poncho_stride: the poncho in the side walk's PASS frames, keyed by the legs (motion rebuild 2026-10-21,
# docs/MOTION_P2.md 7.3). The pass draws the hang's rest view under the torso's lifted run view: these views (the pass
# keys walkB2 and walkD2 only, so idles, hurts, falls and postures are untouched) close the row between them and widen
# the hang's back edge over the crossed legs' seat. GARB (motion rebuild). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role garment poncho
layer hangFront
anchor hip
keys legs
z 1

view D key walkB2 origin 0 0
|.

view U key walkB2 origin 0 0
|.

view D key walkD2 origin 0 0
|.

view U key walkD2 origin 0 0
|.


view R key walkB2 origin 5 0
|59888888775

view R key walkD2 origin 5 0
|59888888775

view L key walkB2 origin 6 0
|59888888775

view L key walkD2 origin 6 0
|59888888775
